              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awulukukili ifuku denodu, awutapili nampoku yakabali, niantu ejima adiŋumu wayijilumwini ji-i ifuku dodenodu, mwomwejima mweliliyi Lakishi.",
          "type": "text",
