          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Awulukukili, awutapili nampoku yakabali nimwanta wawu ninyikala yawu yejima, niantu ejima adiŋumu. Hashiyili hoku niwumuku, mwomwejima mweliliyi Egeloni, wawujilumwini ji-i niantu ejima adiŋumu.",
          "type": "text",
