        {
          "text": "Nochu Yoshuwa watapili ituŋa dejima, nikumapidi, nikukabeta kakuchidiilu, nidakunkumuka nidanyikandu, nianyanta jawu ejima; hashiyili niwumuku, wayijilumwini ejima onenaŋa ji-i, mwomwalejeliyi Yehova Nzambi yaIsarela. ",
